    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Doobiiwnata ea alooheeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adirukwiidi ng'asheega ng'uyeega, ak adibareanyeewi siida muy seara, gayhuuwa muushoocheanda ng'uyeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiyaadi geeshta eemeeda weay gwasin ng'asheega munyas, ghana amaseawa eemeeda weay gamuuwu ng'asheega ng'uyeega, aba gheeda girgweageeda, aba gideaba gaygahuta doobiiwnata siida, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "adisissi siida bwarbwar shiitmeeda aba girgweageadaanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inyas giroonyeewi digeeda roat bea weajoocheandaang'u, adeelsiina seabwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyas gidaahi digeeda siida sinyi nea niibeada ea sareenda, eara ea migassi adiidu gisuudi, weada ghang'eat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adihuti gitoobiiwsa siidaang'u bwarbwar aba jeeda girgweageadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ang'aamwana geaw ng'asheega ng'uyeega adibwari fuga mandeawana giidiinyeanda ea gea doobiiweadi aba gideaba maydageandeawa munyinda siida muy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiing'waanyi lapiyeeda seawshooda, aba gideaba seawshooda gayghwanung' gang'oowiidi gheanyanga fuga ang'wearu ak ghwadatas girgweageeda fuga doobiiweadi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adooghabwaschi rabascheanda, agooga ghoanali giduurji guroorooda rabascheanda, aba gideaba ghayi eara agooga goowooschi rabasta aba ng'eanyiida Misri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gweanyeew ispwa ea eawooji ispwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bwara ng'eanyi gweanyeew lah, nea gilaji boagaagu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gweaydeaba ispwa gaynung'waada madamnyeandaang'u gwalil, ak abeeda ghwanyas fugaagu barbari gichea ghwaak; ak abeeda gidabit gayghwaak sea diyeanga jarooda. Ak gaysindunu eara aba madamnyeandaang'u bea sabiibu ea madamnyeandaang'u bea saytuunajeega.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gaysina gadiyoojigaagu eawooji lah, ak eaweedeaba ispwa gayfuufa, eara heeydaang'u ea digeadaang'u gaygafuuf, ak eara orjeeda soomjeandaang'u was gatmooda ea rabascheanda gaygafuuf. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oang'waanya muuchi ng'asheesu seaniin earukuneegwean, adooruku gheawunga aseecheeka suuk, adeeyiing'isa eara ghuutaang'u.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ghweelmooji samwagu hees",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gaysinnean ghweelmeeda niba samwagu aba jeeda gweayda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaysina ghweelmeeda mukaateeyda meamwatawiida, gawuurji gidearukuteaydi, gajaga mukaateeyda meamwatawiida eawooji ispwa, gajeesin damanda hit bea sheetamwan ghana ghawghaw, aba gideaba damanda ghayi oorinani ng'eanyiida Misri. Ea manda siida jea ghwahidu madeedeanyu nea manda geatinda gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gajasina ghweelmeeda lajita booga, was haghweega madeeda bea madamnyeandaang'u, was gea ihisti aba jeeda madamnyeanda. Gajasina ghweelmeeda siiwaam booga bea muudeanooda gweayda, siiwaam leabu madamnyeanda ea haghweega gadiyeadaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fugaagu was headiga gaygaweay madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA niba samwagu aba jeeda gweayda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adiidu gisabi geadi foojeanda lukghumeedeanyu sea mukaateeyda simwatawiit, ghana nagheeda ghweelmeedeanyu adagoobiida heeda ea ghoah sakteayda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gea madeeda was haghweega madeeda bea madamnyeandaang'u gajeani jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adiiwaali dayeenda mbooyda sea eanooga ghaamwat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Neajeesiinda ea gichea eabeada",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'ula gaydeajeagu malaykajeanda goosheedeaweey madeadaang'u, gafurnyi aba naweeda, ak ghwaanyi ea ghoahiitaneey heeda easinneey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oaleaydiit ak ghoayiinyi ghuutaanyi, adiidu ghoaheawi ng'asheagaaschi, aba gideaba maygwasamsa riing'eedeang'wa aba gideaba gheawungeasu gwanda jeadaanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
